activity Receive Currency
activity Verify Currency Authenticity
activity Approve Exchange
activity Reject Exchange
activity Process Exchange
activity Calculate Exchange Rate
activity Update Exchange Rates
activity Record Transaction
activity Notify Customer
activity Issue Receipt
bind Receive Currency: Amount, Currency Type, Transaction ID
bind Verify Currency Authenticity: Transaction ID
bind Approve Exchange: Exchange Status, Transaction ID
bind Reject Exchange: Exchange Status, Transaction ID
bind Process Exchange: Exchange Rate, Transaction ID
bind Calculate Exchange Rate: Exchange Rate
bind Update Exchange Rates: Exchange Rate
bind Record Transaction: Transaction ID
bind Notify Customer: Transaction ID
bind Issue Receipt: Transaction ID
Amount: integer between 1 and 10000
Currency Type: USD, EUR, GBP, JPY
Exchange Rate: float between 0.5 and 1.5
Exchange Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Transaction ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Init[Receive Currency] | |
End[Issue Receipt] | |
Precedence[Verify Currency Authenticity, Approve Exchange] | | |
Precedence[Receive Currency, Verify Currency Authenticity] | | |
Precedence[Calculate Exchange Rate, Process Exchange] | | |
Precedence[Process Exchange, Record Transaction] | |A.Transaction ID == T.Transaction ID |
Chain Succession[Calculate Exchange Rate, Update Exchange Rates] | | |0,30,s
Chain Succession[Receive Currency, Record Transaction] | |A.Transaction ID == T.Transaction ID |0,1,s
Response[Approve Exchange, Process Exchange] |A.Exchange Status is Approved | |0,2,s
Response[Reject Exchange, Notify Customer] |A.Exchange Status is Rejected | |0,1,s
Existence[Calculate Exchange Rate] | |
Exactly[Approve Exchange] | |
Not Co-Existence[Verify Currency Authenticity, Approve Exchange] | | |
Not Succession[Receive Currency, Reject Exchange] | | |
Responded Existence[Process Exchange, Update Exchange Rates] | | |